---
<section id="testimonials" class="py-24">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="mb-16 text-center reveal-on-scroll">
      <h2>Don't take our <span class="font-serif italic text-gradient">word</span> for it.</h2>
      <p>Join 1,000+ growth teams scaling their outreach with PullLeads.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="masonry-grid">
      <!-- Item 1 -->
      <div class="review-card glass-panel reveal-on-scroll">
        <p class="review-text">"The deliverability is insane. We went from 70% bounce rates with bought lists to <span class="highlight">95% open rates</span> with PullLeads. It pays for itself in day one."</p>
        <div class="review-author">
          <div class="avatar" style="background-image: url('https://i.pravatar.cc/100?img=11');"></div>
          <div class="meta">
            <span class="name">Alex Chen</span>
            <span class="role">Growth @ ScaleUp</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Item 2 -->
      <div class="review-card glass-panel reveal-on-scroll">
        <p class="review-text">"Finally a tool that gets OWNER emails. No more navigating through gatekeepers. Direct access to decision makers."</p>
        <div class="review-author">
          <div class="avatar" style="background-image: url('https://i.pravatar.cc/100?img=12');"></div>
          <div class="meta">
            <span class="name">Sarah Johnson</span>
            <span class="role">Founder, AgencyX</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Item 3 -->
      <div class="review-card glass-panel reveal-on-scroll">
        <p class="review-text">"The Maps extraction is surprisingly accurate. We target local businesses and this is the only tool that finds them all."</p>
        <div class="review-author">
          <div class="avatar" style="background-image: url('https://i.pravatar.cc/100?img=33');"></div>
          <div class="meta">
            <span class="name">Mike Ross</span>
            <span class="role">Sales Director</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Item 4 -->
      <div class="review-card glass-panel reveal-on-scroll">
        <p class="review-text">"Connected straight to our HubSpot. The workflow is seamless."</p>
        <div class="review-author">
          <div class="avatar" style="background-image: url('https://i.pravatar.cc/100?img=44');"></div>
          <div class="meta">
            <span class="name">Elena V.</span>
            <span class="role">Ops Manager</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Item 5 -->
      <div class="review-card glass-panel reveal-on-scroll">
        <p class="review-text">"Support is top notch. Had a question about the API and got a dev response in minutes."</p>
        <div class="review-author">
          <div class="avatar" style="background-image: url('https://i.pravatar.cc/100?img=5');"></div>
          <div class="meta">
            <span class="name">Tom B.</span>
            <span class="role">CTO</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

       <!-- Item 6 -->
       <div class="review-card glass-panel reveal-on-scroll">
        <p class="review-text">"Game changer for local SEO agencies. We can find every business without a website in seconds."</p>
        <div class="review-author">
          <div class="avatar" style="background-image: url('https://i.pravatar.cc/100?img=6');"></div>
          <div class="meta">
            <span class="name">Marcus D.</span>
            <span class="role">Agency Owner</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .py-24 { padding: 6rem 0; }
  .mb-16 { margin-bottom: 4rem; }
  .text-center { text-align: center; }

  .masonry-grid {
    column-count: 1;
    column-gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .masonry-grid { column-count: 2; }
  }

  @media (min-width: 1024px) {
    .masonry-grid { column-count: 3; }
  }

  .review-card {
    break-inside: avoid;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    padding: 2rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    transition: transform 0.3s ease;
  }

  .review-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-5px);
    border-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.2);
  }

  .review-text {
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .highlight {
    color: var(--accent-glow);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .review-author {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-top: auto;
  }

  .avatar {
    width: 40px;
    height: 40px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background-size: cover;
    background-color: var(--bg-secondary);
  }

  .meta {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .name {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .role {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }
</style>